  "bodyHash": "4a2634ad6420ae59",
  "content": "<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" ></p>\n<p><img style=display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\"></p>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\"></p>\n\n</center>\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>&laquo;厌倦了《我的世界》基础的用户界面？受够了走近附魔台却只看到与工作台相同的灰色菜单？想要为你的游戏增添一些色彩吗？</p>\n<p>隆重推出彩色容器！这是一款容器 GUI 替换模组，旨在为《我的世界》中每一个色彩丰富的交互方块匹配专属菜单&raquo;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 style=\"line-height: normal;\">而现在，我带来完全<strong>重</strong>制、<strong>重</strong>绘纹理、<strong>重</strong>新构想的版本 —— Recolourful Containers（焕彩容器），支持新版本、新纹理以及更沉浸的体验！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\">所有 GUI 的设计灵感均来源于其关联的方块。修复了原版《我的世界》纹理问题，更改了 HUD，甚至包括原版中的动画 GUI，还有更多<strong>更多！</strong></p>\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已更改纹理图形：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>已更改纹理列表：</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>铁砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>制图台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>切石机&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>锻造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>投掷器、发射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>熔炉、高炉、烟熏炉&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" > <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>带箱子的船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>带箱子的矿车</li>\n<li>鹦鹉螺壳和僵尸鹦鹉螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品栏</li>\n<li>配方书</li>\n<li>书</li>\n<li>信标</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>经验条&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" > <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>一些小的 UI 更改和修复</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>“Vanilla+”特性 </strong>（更多信息请阅读“安装指南”）<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>带有职业的村民 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" ></li>\n<li>末影箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li> barrels (桶)</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡子、驴、羊驼</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 特性：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>带有所有类型和职业组合的村民 GUI <em>(仅限 OptiGUI)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" > <em>(仅限 Animatica)</em></li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>圣诞箱子</li>\n<li>带有变体的铜箱子 <em>(仅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>桶 <em>(仅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡子、驴（带或不带箱子 - <em>仅限 OptiGUI</em>）</li>\n<li>羊驼（带有地毯颜色）</li>\n<li>破损、损坏的铁砧 <em>(仅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>已书写之书 <em>(仅限 OptiGUI+Animatica)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li> lectern 上的书 <em>(仅限 OptiGUI 3.0+)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模组支持：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories (饰品)</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma (盔甲变色)</li>\n<li>Axiom (公理)</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>(仅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying (不死图腾) <em>(仅限 OptiGUI)</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting (更好的附魔)</li>\n<li>Cloth Config ( Cloth 配置)</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar (详细盔甲条)</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper (物品交换)</li>\n<li>Language Reload (语言重载)</li>\n<li>Mod Menu (模组菜单)</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources (递归资源)</li>\n<li>Sawmill (锯木厂)</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To (他们在做什么)</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<center>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">如果您想要完整的体验，需要安装 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine</h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n</center>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>如果您不想使用 OptiGUI，或者仅使用 OptiFine 模组，您可以在语言设置中激活内置的“Vanilla+”模式</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用方法：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如需其他语言支持，请使用<strong>补充资源</strong>选项卡中的独立 VANILLA+ 包</p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\"></h4><details>\n<summary>常见问题解答：</summary>\n<h4><strong>问：关于任何不在本列表中的内容，我可以去哪里提问？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Recolourful Discord 服务器</a>并在那里提问！</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知问题列表：</summary>\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 时：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民职业无法正常工作</li>\n<li>桶显示箱子的 GUI 纹理</li>\n<li>带箱子的船显示上次访问过的类似箱子的容器 GUI 纹理</li>\n<li>某些马类实体不受支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您仅使用 OptiFine，建议使用“Vanilla+”模式</p>\n</details>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>问：箱子/潜影盒/村民职业 GUI 不起作用！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>检查您是否安装了 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或者已将语言更改为“Vanilla+”</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：你能添加对 X 模组的支持吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>简短回答：理论上可以。请在评论区留下您的建议或在 Discord 中提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用 Recolourful Containers 吗 / 我可以修改 Recolourful Containers 吗 / 我对 Recolourful Containers 可以做 X 吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>请查看描述底部的使用条款</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我想支持你！我该怎么做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>关于这一点……</p>\n</details>\n\n\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果您不需要服务器但仍然想支持我，<strong>请与你的朋友分享此包，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等平台上展示它！</strong>只需留下到此页面的链接，我会非常感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<center>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>别忘了点赞并关注以获取未来更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"215\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n</center>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/chris_xeno/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 为他最初的彩色容器纹理包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 帮助编写自定义着色器代码，许多功能得以实现归功于他</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Kryqu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Kryqu</a></strong> 为村民 GUI 提供灵感</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用条款：</summary>\n<p><strong>如果您认为不能对此包进行某些操作，请先问我 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>将此包包含在免费整合包中</li>\n<li>将此包包含在您的私人服务器中</li>\n<li>修改此包（仅限个人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何形式的媒体中使用此包，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未经我的同意，以任何形式在任何平台上分发此包、其资产及修改后的资产</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<hr>",
